{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39837952",
      "title": "Handling Form Submission",
      "sourceHash": "9434b92bc04f9b4fdc1e58b9b466af6716b03d4bbc21c04c47b9c409241691b2",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.51,
          "end": 3.78,
          "en": "So let's get started dealing with forms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.78,
          "end": 7.47,
          "en": "And for that I'm in the login JSX file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.47,
          "end": 11.13,
          "en": "which is responsible for displaying this form here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.13,
          "end": 13.293,
          "en": "on the screen, this login form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.22,
          "end": 16.65,
          "en": "And I will start by exploring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.65,
          "end": 19.89,
          "en": "how we can handle the submission of this form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.89,
          "end": 23.61,
          "en": "and how we can extract those different values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.61,
          "end": 26.46,
          "en": "And there are a couple of possible approaches",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.46,
          "end": 27.78,
          "en": "I wanna walk you through,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.78,
          "end": 30.63,
          "en": "so that you can use the approach you want to use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.63,
          "end": 32.013,
          "en": "in your application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.09,
          "end": 35.73,
          "en": "By the way, you might notice in this form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.73,
          "end": 38.94,
          "en": "that on this label element here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.94,
          "end": 42.597,
          "en": "we got a special prop named \"htmlFor.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.53,
          "end": 47.31,
          "en": "This is the react equivalent to the for attribute,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.31,
          "end": 50.94,
          "en": "which you would set in native HTML.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.94,
          "end": 53.583,
          "en": "So if this were not JSX here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.45,
          "end": 59.13,
          "en": "But just as you need class name for adding CSS classes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.13,
          "end": 63.21,
          "en": "you need htmlFor instead of just using for,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.21,
          "end": 68.03999999999999,
          "en": "because both class and for are reserved names in JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.03999999999999,
          "end": 72.063,
          "en": "and therefore are, in the end, not set as prop names here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.93,
          "end": 76.11,
          "en": "So that's just something to also be aware of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.11,
          "end": 79.65,
          "en": "So to handle form submission, we in the end wanna listen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.65,
          "end": 83.16,
          "en": "to this login button being clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.16,
          "end": 87.03,
          "en": "This reset button should later reset the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 87.03,
          "end": 90.21000000000001,
          "en": "and we'll also explore how to do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 90.21000000000001,
          "end": 93.66,
          "en": "but it's the login button I wanna focus on first",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.66,
          "end": 95.67,
          "en": "so that we can actually deal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.67,
          "end": 97.443,
          "en": "with the submission of the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.43,
          "end": 102.50999999999999,
          "en": "So to do that, in this login component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.50999999999999,
          "end": 104.34,
          "en": "we could add a new function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.34,
          "end": 108.39,
          "en": "which could be called handleSubmission",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.39,
          "end": 109.443,
          "en": "or handleSubmit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.34,
          "end": 113.28,
          "en": "The name of course is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.28,
          "end": 117.6,
          "en": "And we could bind this function as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.6,
          "end": 120.84,
          "en": "to the onClick prop of this login button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.84,
          "end": 123.72,
          "en": "so that whenever this button is pressed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.72,
          "end": 126.273,
          "en": "this handleSubmit function is called.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.89,
          "end": 131.07,
          "en": "And now in here, we could then deal with the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.07,
          "end": 133.05,
          "en": "that was entered by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.05,
          "end": 134.64,
          "en": "But in order to do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.64,
          "end": 137.223,
          "en": "we of course also must get that data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.09,
          "end": 139.53,
          "en": "Before we do that though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.53,
          "end": 143.19,
          "en": "I wanna check whether this function is called as intended,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 143.19,
          "end": 147.21,
          "en": "and therefore I'll simply console log submitted here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 147.21,
          "end": 149.463,
          "en": "A simple console log message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.84,
          "end": 154.35,
          "en": "And if we now save everything and go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 154.35,
          "end": 159.35,
          "en": "and open the developer tools and I click log in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 159.6,
          "end": 162.87,
          "en": "Huh, we see something strange.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 162.87,
          "end": 164.4,
          "en": "When I click log in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 164.4,
          "end": 167.52,
          "en": "you briefly see the word \"submitted\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 167.52,
          "end": 172.41,
          "en": "flash here on the right, but then it disappears.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 172.41,
          "end": 174.903,
          "en": "And why is that happening?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 175.86,
          "end": 180.54,
          "en": "Well, this console log here basically gets emptied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 180.54,
          "end": 184.77,
          "en": "and refreshed whenever the page reloads.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 184.77,
          "end": 187.74,
          "en": "So it seems that the page is reloading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 187.74,
          "end": 190.05,
          "en": "after clicking login.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 190.05,
          "end": 192.36,
          "en": "And indeed that is what's happening.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 192.36,
          "end": 195.96,
          "en": "And you can tell by watching this refresh icon here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 195.96,
          "end": 200.28,
          "en": "If I click login, you see it briefly turns to a cross",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 200.28,
          "end": 203.253,
          "en": "after I clicked this button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 204.57,
          "end": 208.47,
          "en": "In addition, you'll also see that this strange part here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 208.47,
          "end": 213.47,
          "en": "was added at the end of my URL, these query parameters here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 214.82999999999998,
          "end": 217.47,
          "en": "And this is all happening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 217.47,
          "end": 220.32,
          "en": "because I am having a button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 220.32,
          "end": 223.5,
          "en": "inside of a form element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 223.5,
          "end": 226.53,
          "en": "And the default browser behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 226.53,
          "end": 229.44,
          "en": "for buttons in form elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 229.44,
          "end": 233.16,
          "en": "is that those buttons will submit the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 233.16,
          "end": 234.99,
          "en": "and technically that means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 234.99,
          "end": 238.86,
          "en": "that an HTTP request is created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 238.86,
          "end": 243.86,
          "en": "and is sent to the server that's serving the website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 244.41,
          "end": 247.653,
          "en": "This is the default built-in behavior.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 248.58,
          "end": 250.8,
          "en": "And this is the default behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 250.8,
          "end": 253.29,
          "en": "because in many non-React apps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 253.29,
          "end": 256.29,
          "en": "you indeed have a full stack application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 256.29,
          "end": 259.23,
          "en": "where every page is rendered by the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 259.23,
          "end": 261.63,
          "en": "and sent to the client thereafter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 261.63,
          "end": 263.82,
          "en": "and where form submissions, therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 263.82,
          "end": 265.92,
          "en": "should be sent back to the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 265.92,
          "end": 268.503,
          "en": "so that they can be handled there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 269.85,
          "end": 272.1,
          "en": "And that's what's happening here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 272.1,
          "end": 276.33,
          "en": "If you go to the network tab and you clear this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 276.33,
          "end": 279.96,
          "en": "you'll see that if I click login here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 279.96,
          "end": 282.15,
          "en": "the whole page is reloaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 282.15,
          "end": 285.27,
          "en": "And you'll see this request here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 285.27,
          "end": 288.72,
          "en": "which was indeed generated and sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 288.72,
          "end": 290.703,
          "en": "automatically by the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 292.08,
          "end": 294.54,
          "en": "And this is an important default behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 294.54,
          "end": 296.49,
          "en": "you must understand.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 296.49,
          "end": 298.71,
          "en": "Buttons, like this login button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 298.71,
          "end": 301.8,
          "en": "but also at the moment the reset button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 301.8,
          "end": 305.16,
          "en": "in form elements will generate requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 305.16,
          "end": 307.86,
          "en": "and send those requests to the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 307.86,
          "end": 309.153,
          "en": "that's serving the site.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 310.05,
          "end": 313.29,
          "en": "But in this case here, for this React application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 313.29,
          "end": 316.32,
          "en": "that's a problem, and it will be a problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 316.32,
          "end": 319.38,
          "en": "in many React applications you're building",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 319.38,
          "end": 323.01,
          "en": "unless you are using some full stack React solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 323.01,
          "end": 324.51,
          "en": "like Next JS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 324.51,
          "end": 328.11,
          "en": "which we will explore in a separate course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 328.11,
          "end": 332.76,
          "en": "And even there, this automatic behavior might be a problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 332.76,
          "end": 337.38,
          "en": "Because here, the server that's serving this React website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 337.38,
          "end": 342.38,
          "en": "on this address is actually a pure development server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 342.57,
          "end": 346.23,
          "en": "It's not prepared to handle this form submission.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 346.23,
          "end": 349.56,
          "en": "We have no code on that server that would deal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 349.56,
          "end": 351.54,
          "en": "with that submission.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 351.54,
          "end": 355.71,
          "en": "And even if you would deploy this React application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 355.71,
          "end": 359.37,
          "en": "on some real server that serves it to real users",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 359.37,
          "end": 360.51,
          "en": "on the internet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 360.51,
          "end": 364.32,
          "en": "that would be a server that only aims to serve",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 364.32,
          "end": 366.3,
          "en": "this index HTML file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 366.3,
          "end": 368.64,
          "en": "and all these JavaScript files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 368.64,
          "end": 372.24,
          "en": "and it still wouldn't be a server that is prepared",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 372.24,
          "end": 376.02,
          "en": "to handle incoming form requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 376.02,
          "end": 381.02,
          "en": "So therefore, this default behavior here is a problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 381.33,
          "end": 384.84,
          "en": "So how can we prevent the default behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 384.84,
          "end": 387.513,
          "en": "of this button submitting the form?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 388.95,
          "end": 391.05,
          "en": "One way of preventing it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 391.05,
          "end": 395.585,
          "en": "is to add the type attribute and prop to this button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 395.585,
          "end": 398.88,
          "en": "and set this to button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 398.88,
          "end": 402.84000000000003,
          "en": "If you set the type to button on a button in a form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 402.84000000000003,
          "end": 405.873,
          "en": "that button will not submit the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 406.8,
          "end": 410.04,
          "en": "because the default type is the submit type,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 410.04,
          "end": 413.28,
          "en": "which you could also set, but which you don't have to set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 413.28,
          "end": 416.3,
          "en": "because, well, as mentioned, it is the default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 416.3,
          "end": 419.97,
          "en": "But if you set this to button, you'll notice that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 419.97,
          "end": 422.34,
          "en": "now if you save that and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 422.34,
          "end": 423.99,
          "en": "if I click login here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 423.99,
          "end": 427.26,
          "en": "now this log message stays here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 427.26,
          "end": 429.51,
          "en": "the page is not getting reloaded,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 429.51,
          "end": 433.2,
          "en": "because now we kind of made this button work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 433.2,
          "end": 434.31,
          "en": "in a different way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 434.31,
          "end": 436.32,
          "en": "We make sure that this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 436.32,
          "end": 438.483,
          "en": "is no longer submitting the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 439.74,
          "end": 441.453,
          "en": "So that's one way of doing it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 442.41,
          "end": 445.68,
          "en": "But another way, a more elegant way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 445.68,
          "end": 447.57,
          "en": "which will also later help us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 447.57,
          "end": 450.66,
          "en": "with extracting the entered values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 450.66,
          "end": 453.63,
          "en": "is to keep the type to submit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 453.63,
          "end": 456.96,
          "en": "by not setting any type at all, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 456.96,
          "end": 461.96,
          "en": "and to remove this onClick listener here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 462,
          "end": 467,
          "en": "and to instead add the onSubmit event handler prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 467.55,
          "end": 468.963,
          "en": "to the form element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 469.8,
          "end": 474.8,
          "en": "Because the form here will actually trigger a submit event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 475.83,
          "end": 478.38,
          "en": "to which you can listen and react",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 478.38,
          "end": 480.24,
          "en": "whenever it is submitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 480.24,
          "end": 482.193,
          "en": "by one of its buttons being pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 483.87,
          "end": 487.62,
          "en": "So it's now here where we want to trigger handleSubmit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 487.62,
          "end": 489.27,
          "en": "And I'm doing this here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 489.27,
          "end": 493.23,
          "en": "because now we'll automatically get an event object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 493.23,
          "end": 497.31,
          "en": "I mean, we get such an event object for every event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 497.31,
          "end": 499.98,
          "en": "that's being triggered for click events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 499.98,
          "end": 502.923,
          "en": "just like for change events or the submit event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 504.03,
          "end": 506.82,
          "en": "But this event object, which we do get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 506.82,
          "end": 509.28,
          "en": "for this submit event here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 509.28,
          "end": 512.76,
          "en": "now has a special method which we can call,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 512.76,
          "end": 515.463,
          "en": "the preventDefault method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 517.65,
          "end": 521.04,
          "en": "And this method does what the name implies,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 521.04,
          "end": 524.64,
          "en": "it prevents the default browser behavior,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 524.64,
          "end": 529.443,
          "en": "which would be to generate and send this HTTP request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 530.7,
          "end": 533.79,
          "en": "And that is indeed therefore a pattern",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 533.79,
          "end": 537.69,
          "en": "which you will see in many React applications,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 537.69,
          "end": 541.14,
          "en": "that you listen to the submit event of a form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 541.14,
          "end": 544.95,
          "en": "and that then you start by calling event preventDefault",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 544.95,
          "end": 548.13,
          "en": "before then adding your actual JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 548.13,
          "end": 551.46,
          "en": "and React event handling logic thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 551.46,
          "end": 555.36,
          "en": "Though, I will say that React also offers you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 555.36,
          "end": 558.84,
          "en": "yet another way of handling form submissions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 558.84,
          "end": 563.64,
          "en": "at least if you are using at least React version 19.",
