        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 563.64,
          "end": 566.49,
          "en": "In older versions, that other way will not exist.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 566.49,
          "end": 569.55,
          "en": "But if you're using React 19 or higher,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 569.55,
          "end": 572.37,
          "en": "then you can also handle form submissions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 572.37,
          "end": 575.25,
          "en": "with a feature called Form Actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 575.25,
          "end": 578.31,
          "en": "Now we'll take a closer look at that feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 578.31,
          "end": 580.44,
          "en": "in the next course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 580.44,
          "end": 583.29,
          "en": "We'll take an in-depth look at it there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 583.29,
          "end": 586.8,
          "en": "because in this section we'll use that other approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 586.8,
          "end": 588.81,
          "en": "where we use the onSubmit prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 588.81,
          "end": 590.55,
          "en": "and handle the submission manually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 590.55,
          "end": 592.68,
          "en": "with that submit event handler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 592.68,
          "end": 595.35,
          "en": "Because this is a pattern and an approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 595.35,
          "end": 598.62,
          "en": "which you'll see in many React projects out there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 598.62,
          "end": 601.17,
          "en": "Also, because that other approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 601.17,
          "end": 602.82,
          "en": "this form actions approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 602.82,
          "end": 604.92,
          "en": "which we'll explore in the next section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 604.92,
          "end": 608.67,
          "en": "will not work with older react versions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 608.67,
          "end": 613.05,
          "en": "This approach here will work in older versions as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 613.05,
          "end": 616.77,
          "en": "So that's what we'll focus on in this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 616.77,
          "end": 619.32,
          "en": "And therefore now with this approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 619.32,
          "end": 624.32,
          "en": "if you save that and reload, if we click login,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 624.33,
          "end": 627,
          "en": "you also see that submitted stays here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 627,
          "end": 629.913,
          "en": "and that the page is not getting reloaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 630.96,
          "end": 632.85,
          "en": "And that's therefore the approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 632.85,
          "end": 635.64,
          "en": "you typically use in React apps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
